<title>USA: Harris Cty MUD 4, Texas won by Southwest Sec..</title>
<headline>Harris Cty MUD 4, Texas won by Southwest Sec..</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Southwest Securities said it won</p>
<p>$1.970 million of Harris Cty Municipal Utility Dist No. 4, Texas,</p>
<p>waterworks and sewer system combination unlimited tax and revenue</p>
<p>bonds, Series 1996, with a net interest cost of 5.403 percent.</p>
